<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-JAPAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-JAPAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $1.22 million</p>
<p>Japan Open tennis championships on Friday (Prefix denotes</p>
<p>seedings):</p>
<p>Men's fourth round</p>
<p>1-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat 8-David Prinosil</p>
<p>(Germany) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>6-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat 4-Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>6-4 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat 13-Mark Woodforde (Australia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>16-Lionel Roux (France) beat 7-Martin Damm (Czech Rep.) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Women's semifinal</p>
<p>3-Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat Annabel Ellwood (Australia) 6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
